## Exp39 — In-Corridor Path Dynamics Family — REJECTED

Frozen six-coordinate causal path family:

```text
HAZARD: PATH_LENGTH, VISITED_SPAN, TURN_RATE
SIDE:   SIGNED_EFFICIENCY, FORWARD_RETRACE, BACK_RETRACE
```

Before valid scoring, implementation audits established the exact historical upstream semantics:

```text
parent sign = sign(parent_close-parent_open)
TRUE FULL onset = current FULL
                  AND exact 5-minute M5 contiguity
                  AND current FULL state != previous state
```

Dedicated pre-run audit reproduced `5209` exact historical FULL onsets; prepared `direction` produced only `4379`, proving it was not the historical definition. No score was inspected during failed reproduction attempts.

Valid run reproduced the exact Exp20/21 universe above. TRAIN path coordinates were strongly redundant, including state-weighted `rho(PATH_LENGTH,VISITED_SPAN)=0.9029` and episode-weighted `rho=0.9465`.

TRAIN factorized coefficients:

```text
HAZARD PATH_LENGTH       -0.209319
HAZARD VISITED_SPAN      +0.461219
HAZARD TURN_RATE         -0.099886
SIDE   SIGNED_EFFICIENCY -0.139144
SIDE   FORWARD_RETRACE   -0.015379
SIDE   BACK_RETRACE      +0.545116
```

Primary JOINT6 vs frozen SEMI:

```text
VALIDATION Brier   +0.000165920 CI[-0.002574581,+0.002666242]
VALIDATION LogLoss +0.001112041 CI[-0.003997531,+0.006368177]
TEST       Brier   -0.001014505 CI[-0.003461134,+0.001367184]
TEST       LogLoss -0.001854969 CI[-0.006554982,+0.002366650]
```

Formal:

```text
EXP39_PRIMARY_FAMILY_STRICT_PASS = FALSE
IN_CORRIDOR_PATH_DYNAMICS_INCREMENTAL_FAMILY = REJECTED
HAZARD3_INCREMENT = NOT_TRANSPORTABLE
SIDE3_INCREMENT = NOT_CONFIRMED
```

No PATH/VISITED_SPAN subset, BACK_RETRACE-only, TURN_RATE removal, recent 3/6/12-bar path, threshold/bucket, alternate transform, Exp38+Exp39 combination, or contextual rescue is allowed.

Scientific consequence after Exp38-39: `CorridorPosition` remains the core coordinate; `Dwell` remains the only preserved historical challenger; deeper frontier and realized path history do not provide a stable third one-step coordinate. This strengthens, without proving, local sufficiency of the current active corridor representation.

